{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお昼から\n友達と遊んできた〜＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"半年ぶりに会った！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々にプリというものを撮ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生の頃とかよく撮ったけど\nその頃よりも時代は進歩していましたよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯食べてゆっくりして\n楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/01/10/6148984/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜は真夏を誘って\nバンドでボーカルやってる友達のライブを\n見に行ってきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は地元の中学、高校に行かなかったんだけど\nそれでも小中高ずっと一緒の学校に通った貴重な友達なんだ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校の頃なんかは\n夏休みも毎日遊んでたし(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこよかったな〜(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、中高一緒だった友達に\n会う機会が多くて嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな久々に会うし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、楽しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/01/10/6148984/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/01/10/6148984/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"667の記事で言ってた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが\nうちのうしろからこんにちはしてる感じ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の具体例。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}